    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Overview:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2000, explorers discovered a hidden Hindu civilization submerged under the Indian Ocean. They found ancient statues of Brahma, Vishnu, and Mahesh emitting a mysterious, dark energy. The site was filled with only corpses and abandoned Hindu statues remaining. Secretly, Indian and global scientists began experimenting with the statues, trying to harness their power. However, one experiment went terribly wrong, causing a massive explosion that created a black hole. This black hole led to a collision between different dimensions and magical worlds in the multiverse. As a result, anomalies started occurring all around the world. To protect the world and hide the truth, a secret society was formed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/424e9ace7430ceac28218f8763433139.poster.avif?t=1730979263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/424e9ace7430ceac28218f8763433139.webm?t=1730979263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Key Features:</i></strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Pack :</strong>\u00a0Engage in thrilling, myth-inspired combat with diverse weapons and destructible environments that enhance strategic play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/d06d8b7a57b37563c3c478719b625253.poster.avif?t=1730979263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/d06d8b7a57b37563c3c478719b625253.webm?t=1730979263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Gameplay :</strong>\u00a0The game runs smoothly with quick, realistic movements and easy-to-use controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/6eef528d83babc91f2ed76a8e514dfe3.poster.avif?t=1730979263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/6eef528d83babc91f2ed76a8e514dfe3.webm?t=1730979263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong>\u00a0Experience stunning scenery and effects that make the mythological world feel alive and vibrant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/6b69a6fb8a01b7c2522b978d2149e636.poster.avif?t=1730979263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/6b69a6fb8a01b7c2522b978d2149e636.webm?t=1730979263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Battles:</strong> Select between solo or team-based gameplay across various multiplayer modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/47a10e6bdf0e2c582fae23327946e3ca.poster.avif?t=1730979263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026030/extras/47a10e6bdf0e2c582fae23327946e3ca.webm?t=1730979263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
